	I got it running under VMS with little trouble.  I added a vmsbuild.com
procedure.  I put in a compile time definition to direct LARNHOME to the correct
directory.  I modified tgetent.c to look for the termcap file in the LARNDIR
directory (for VMS only).  To now run it,

$ define larndir WHATEVER-DIRECTORY-LARN-IS-IN
$ run larn

E-mail me if you want more specifics or the command procedure and changes.


